# PART 7 — UNIFIED DOWNLOAD STATES

Create a clear state model.

Suggested states:

```kotlin
sealed interface DownloadStatus {
    data object Resolving : DownloadStatus
    data object Queued : DownloadStatus
    data object WaitingForNetwork : DownloadStatus
    data object WaitingForConstraints : DownloadStatus
    data object Running : DownloadStatus
    data object Paused : DownloadStatus
    data object Completed : DownloadStatus
    data object Failed : DownloadStatus
    data object Cancelling : DownloadStatus
    data object Cancelled : DownloadStatus
    data object Unsupported : DownloadStatus
}
```

Adapt this model to the actual project conventions.

Requirements:

- Accurate state transitions.
- No fake progress.
- No false success notifications.
- Clear error messages.
- Correct state restoration.
- Engine-specific limitations communicated to the UI.

The UI must only show an operation as completed after the engine confirms it.

